From {{inh|en|enm|set}}, {{m|enm|sette}}, from {{inh|en|ang|set|t=seat, place of residence, camp, settlement, entrenchment, stable, pen}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*set|t=seat}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*setą|t=seat}}.

