# {{lb|en|music}} A musical [[performance]] by a [[band]], [[disc jockey]], etc., consisting of several musical pieces.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=June 26, 2017|author=Alexis Petridis| title=Glastonbury 2017 verdict: Radiohead, Foo Fighters, Lorde, Stormzy and more| work=the Guardian| url=https://www.theguardian.com/music/2017/jun/26/glastonbury-2017-verdict-radiohead-foo-fighters-lorde-stormzy-and-more| passage=You heard “oh, Jeremy Corbyn” everywhere: at the silent disco, during Radiohead’s Friday night headlining '''set''', midway through the Other stage appearance by rapper Stormzy, who gamely joined in. }}
# {{lb|en|music}} A [[drum kit]], a [[drum set]].
#: {{ux|en|He plays the '''set''' on Saturdays.}}
